<p>
Loving God,
</p>

<p>
Despair or hope?
</p>

<p>
That was the choice<br>
on that day when<br>
all seemed lost.
</p>

<p>
Though it may<br>
seem foolish,<br>
we choose hope,<br>
and wait to see<br>
what tomorrow brings.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


